      "note": [
        "Protected nature in this table is national parks, nature reserves, nature management areas, biotope protection areas (in forests and other land) and the Royal National City Park.",
        "A locality consists of a group of buildings having at least 200 inhabitants. ",
        "The table consists of all localities/urban areas with more than 10 000 inhabitants at the reference year of the locality/urban area. 2020 urban areas have been used in the calculation of statistics for 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023. The urban areas of 2023 have been used in the calculation of statistics from 2024 onwards. Previous versions of urban areas have been used in the calculation of statistical values for previous years.",
        "Localities located in more than one municipality is registered on the municipalty where the largest part of the locality is."
